{"id":"dd527eaf83c7e032","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution.md","title":"一阶子句实例保持模型满足","display":"lem-first-order-clause-substitution — 一阶子句实例保持模型满足","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution"],"display":"lem-first-order-clause-substitution — 一阶子句实例保持模型满足","depends_on":["[[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]]","[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; full local simultaneous-substitution proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-first-order-clause-substitution — 一阶子句实例保持模型满足"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4450994380fbceab\" href=\"?note=4450994380fbceab\" title=\"72-df-first-order-clause-validity\">72-df-first-order-clause-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b286b5d2520ff936\" href=\"?note=b286b5d2520ff936\" title=\"72-lem-semantic-substitution\">72-lem-semantic-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.6.2 print61/PDF73; full local simultaneous-substitution proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_\\theta\">\\(s_\\theta\\)</span> 是下式定义的赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_\\theta(x):=⟦\\theta(x)⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}\\quad(x\\in V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_\\theta(x):=⟦\\theta(x)⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}\\quad(x\\in V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C\\theta\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s_\\theta\\models_{cl}C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C\\theta\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s_\\theta\\models_{cl}C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\theta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\theta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对项树证明同时代入的值等于在sθ下原项的值：变量正是赋值定义，常元不变，函数逐分量使用归纳假设。正原子随关系解释成立，负文字按经典补集成立，再对集合中存在一个真文字取等价。全称满足式对每个s应用前式。这里只处理无绑定文字，不把有限同时代入误写为可能捕获的量词内替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-first-order-clause-validity","status":"resolved","id":"4450994380fbceab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-semantic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"b286b5d2520ff936","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Structure}_\\Sigma(\\mathfrak M)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathsf{FOClause}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"s_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"s_\\theta(x):=⟦\\theta(x)⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}\\quad(x\\in V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M,s\\models_{cl}C\\theta\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak M,s_\\theta\\models_{cl}C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models_{cl}C\\theta.","display":true}],"bytes":1680,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-in